cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Wikingo: Wikipedia Micro-learning"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "aresthebellator (exertia group)"
    alias: aresthebellator
abstract: >-
  Wikingo is a gamified micro-learning web app, developed at the Wikipedia
  Hackathon in Messina (2-4 October 2026), that turns random Wikipedia
  article summaries into short Duolingo-style quizzes (multiple choice,
  cloze, true/false and subject recognition), organised in a themed lesson
  path with hearts, streaks, sound feedback, Italian/English localisation,
  an offline article pool and optional Firebase sign-in.
keywords:
  - Wikipedia
  - micro-learning
  - gamification
  - quiz generation
  - education
  - progressive web app
  - React
  - TypeScript
  - Firebase
  - hackathon
